# Copy this file to privacy-denylist.txt and keep that copy untracked.
# Add one lab-specific literal per line. Matching is case-insensitive and
# regex metacharacters have no special meaning. Blank lines and lines that
# start with a number sign are ignored.
#
# Do not place credentials or secret values here. Use this for identifiers
# such as local host aliases, inventory prefixes, account names, and site tags.
# Replace these commented shapes with real local identifiers in the ignored copy:
# lab-node-alias
# inventory-prefix
